Player at 42,45, chaoticCleric at 46,44 (distance 5), chaoticWarrior at 51,41. The selected is chaoticWarrior. Could select chaoticCleric instead via roster then move adjacent. To test melee, break from bots noise: after selecting a target, move adjacent and press F. But target moves. We can repeatedly check nearest.

Maybe easiest: press ArrowRight for ~1.1s to move 5 tiles toward the cluster; then stop. Bots converge. Use run-code async:

```
async (page) => {
 const state = ...;
 await page.keyboard.down('ArrowRight');
 await page.waitForTimeout(1200);
 await page.keyboard.up('ArrowRight');
 await page.waitForTimeout(300);
 return await page.evaluate(() => window.AO_DEBUG().fighters...);
}
```

But player movement keys: our `run-code` page is the current page. Yes.

Let's do that; then evaluate positions.

